** Added <code>WOW_PROJECT_CAMELOT</code> (18) constant.<ref> WoWUIDev #bugs: [https://discord.com/channels/327414731654692866/1550603608003842121 WOW_PROJECT_ID for Forever seems to be the same as Retail]</ref>
